<title>USA: Carson City, Nev., won by Dean Witter.</title>
<headline>Carson City, Nev., won by Dean Witter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dean Witter Reynolds Inc. said it won $1.680 million of Carson City, Nev., general obligation limited tax park refunding bonds, Series May 1, 1997 C, with a true interest cost of 5.332 percent.</p>
</text>
